{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"line","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL20MXLStaffLinePositionV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLStaffLinePosition","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLStaffLinePosition"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Maps to a nested MusicXML ","type":"text"},{"code":"<line>","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" element."}]}]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Line numbers are counted from the bottom of the staff. They are only needed with the G, F, and C signs in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order to position a pitch correctly on the staff. Standard values are 2 for the G sign (treble clef), 4 for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the F sign (bass clef), and 3 for the C sign (alto clef). Line values can be used to specify positions outside"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the staff, such as a C clef positioned in the middle of a grand staff."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlclef\/content-swift.struct\/line"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLClef\/Content-swift.struct\/line","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLClef","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLClef\/Content-swift.struct"]]},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","title":"line","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"k